      "html": "<p>Most results for <strong>Care Inspectorate Wales compliance software</strong> are English tools built for CQC. A Welsh care home answers to CIW and to RISCA, with a Responsible Individual and a manager who must show it keeps up all year.</p><p>This page lists the audits a Welsh home keeps, and says plainly what Quickler is not. See also <a href=\"/pages/care-home-compliance-software-uk.html\">care home compliance software UK</a>, <a href=\"/pages/care-home-compliance-software-scotland.html\">Scotland</a>, <a href=\"/pages/rqia-compliance-software-northern-ireland.html\">Northern Ireland</a> and <a href=\"/pages/hiqa-compliance-software-ireland.html\">Ireland</a>, and <a href=\"/pages/five-regulators-one-job-british-isles.html\">five regulators, one job</a>.</p>"
    },
